WEBVTT

00:03:29.331 --> 00:03:32.863
What you have here is two
young chimpanzees who have a box,

00:03:32.887 --> 00:03:35.892
and the box is too heavy
for one chimp to pull in.

00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:37.775
And of course, there's food on the box.

00:03:37.799 --> 00:03:39.800
Otherwise they wouldn't
be pulling so hard.

00:03:39.824 --> 00:03:41.937
And so they're bringing in the box.

00:03:41.961 --> 00:03:44.230
And you can see that they're synchronized.

00:03:44.254 --> 00:03:47.354
You can see that they work together,
they pull at the same moment.

00:03:47.378 --> 00:03:49.891
It's already a big advance
over many other animals

00:03:49.915 --> 00:03:51.553
who wouldn't be able to do that.

00:03:51.577 --> 00:03:53.963
Now you're going to get
a more interesting picture,

00:03:53.987 --> 00:03:56.613
because now one
of the two chimps has been fed.

00:03:56.637 --> 00:04:00.063
So one of the two is not really interested
in the task anymore.